  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Heavenly Court, Duke Long fights Feng Jiu Ge while Fang Yuan works a destiny Gu refinement under destiny song, and Spectral Soul Demon Venerable watches from the periphery with his servants.",
      "chapters": [
        1966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_destiny_gu",
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the same chapter the regional walls that separated the five regions disappear and the earth veins connect, so the five regions merge into one. Fang Yuan names that change as the arrival of the great era and links it to a real chance at eternal life.",
      "chapters": [
        1966
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "opening-of-the-great-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Red Lotus’s goal succeeds, Duke Long dies in the fighting, Fairy Zi Wei is enslaved by Spectral Soul, and Qin Ding Ling takes charge of a damaged Heavenly Court while fate Gu remains destroyed. Spectral Soul lurks near Soul Pacifying grotto-heaven forces and plans to use qi tide chaos to assault other venerable forces and grow faster.",
      "chapters": [
        1970
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "heavenly-court-after-the-fate-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "loc_soul_pacifying_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court Gu Immortals treat the fate war aftermath as the righteous path falling while the demonic path surges, with Duke Long dead and Fang Yuan still free.",
      "chapters": [
        2000
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "righteous-path-after-the-fate-war",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Qing Chou fight, Spectral Soul’s identity is exposed when the immortals recognize that Lady Cold Ash’s body has already been taken over; he fights Qing Chou and Dragon Palace, and his demonic might dominates that battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        2030
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-on-the-battlefield",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_chou",
        "char_lady_cold_ash",
        "house_dragon_palace"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 2209 is titled Limitless’ Death.",
      "chapters": [
        2209
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
